  "prefLabel": "We 602.03 Chlorination",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "We 602.03 Chlorination. A person who completes construction of a new well, installs a new pump in a well, or reinstalls an existing pump in a well shall chlorinate the well to a minimum concentration of 50 parts per million for a minimum of 4 hours upon completion of such construction or installation.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for We 600) #12083 eff 3-1-17",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/we100-1000.html"
